# Keep GitHub's language statistics focused on real source code.
#
# Lockfiles and phase bookkeeping are data, not source — exclude them from
# the language bar (and collapse their diffs in PRs).

Cargo.lock              linguist-generated
*.loop-base             linguist-generated

# Documentation should not count toward the language bar.
docs/**                 linguist-documentation
*.md                    linguist-documentation
crates/flywheel-hub/web/vendor/** linguist-vendored
